      "sourceTextSha256": "73aa806cf23ac7810a6073137c9e9c170f76439c31472067b8228ca4c2271213",
      "text": "Over eight days, you’ll travel through four very different parts of Brazil. Start in the Pantanal wetlands, home to birds, caimans, capybaras and other wildlife. Then head to Bonito for waterfalls, caves and clear rivers. After a flight to northeastern Brazil, explore the white dunes and freshwater lagoons of Lençóis Maranhenses before finishing in historic São Luís.",
